[[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891315\">1084A16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891293\">1076B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891200\">1020A20</a></p><p>1. Undo bolts (1a) and remove big end bearing cap (1b). then remove\nbig end half-bearing (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034092.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<p>Lower the vehicle.</p><p>1. Remove the connecting rod with the piston.</p><p>2. Remove the big end bearing shell.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034093.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Fit the connecting rod - piston assembly and half-bearing (1a)\nusing tool (1b).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Fit the connecting rod - piston\nassembly in the cylinder block/crankcase so that the number stamped\non the small end is facing the inlet side.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034094.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<p>Fit the big end half-bearing and tighten\nthe cap bolts to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CONNECTING ROD CAP FASTENERS</p></td><td><p>M9</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.5 + 60°</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2891200\">1020A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891293\">1076B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891315\">1084A16</a></p>"]]